        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present “The Grove” to the market — a substantial and versatile 4-6 bedroom, 2 bathroom detached residence. Extending to approximately 2,500 sq. ft., the property is currently configured as a 4 bedroom, 1 bathroom residence with an adjoinging 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment.\n\nNestled in a peaceful countryside setting, the property is conveniently located within walking distance (approx. 500m) of Duagh village and its excellent range of local amenities including shop and petrol station, hardware store, national school, GAA club and church while the heritage town of Listowel is just a ten minute drive away. \n\nThe main residence offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprising a welcoming lounge/sitting room, kitchen, living room, utility room, four bedrooms and a family bathroom. The adjoining self-contained apartment comprises a lounge/sitting room, kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom, making it ideal for extended family living, guest accommodation or potential rental income.\n\nThe property is set amidst beautifully landscaped mature gardens which perfectly complement the home. A spacious paved patio area is located off the kitchen/dining room offers an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nThe 80sqm approx outbuilding benefits from an electricity connection and provides excellent space for storage, DIY projects, workshop or hobby use.\n\nThe residence further benefits from oil-fired central heating, double-glazed windows throughout and connection to all essential services.\n\nViewing of this fine property is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 3.44m x 2.98m\nwith wooden laminate flooring, sliding patio door & 2 windows, archway to hallway leading to glazed door and sidelights\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.654m x 3.65m\nwith open fireplace, fitted units, laminate flooring, coving & cornice detail, 2 windows (dual aspect)\n\nKitchen - 4.53m x 3.49m\nivory fitted kitchen with integrated dishwasher, cooker, wall & floor tiles, 2 windows (dual aspect), sliding patio door to rear\n\nLiving Room - 4.55m x 4.01m\nsolid fuel stove with red brick surround, fitted units, cornice detail & window\n\nUtility Room - 2.84m x 1.61m\nplumbed for washing machine, fitted units, wall & floor tiles, access to attic, sink and half glazed door to rear\n\nHallway - 10.57m x 1.30m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.10m x 3.66m\ndouble with sliderobes, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.07m x 3.63m\ndouble with fitted wardrobes, wooden laminate flooring, whb & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.81m x 2.78m\ncompact double with fitted wardrobes, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.83m x 2.73m\ncompact double with fitted wardrobes, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.04m x 2.81m\nluxurious space with large vanity unit and LED mirror, wheelchair accessible shower- Triton electric T90 sr complete with rain shower, heated towel rail, modern, mirrored storage unit, wall & floor tiles, w/c & window\n\nSelf Contained Space - \n\n\nEntrance Hallway - 7.08m x 1.02m\nEntrance via sliding patio doors to side, carpet flooring, coving detail, access via stira stairs\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.48m x 3.96m\nStanley solid fuel stove with stone detail, fitted units, coving detail and cornice detail, wooden laminate flooring & 2 windows (dual aspect)\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.37m x 3.32m\nfitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine, wall & floor tiles & window\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.83m x 2.73m\ncompact double with wooden laminate flooring, fitted units & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.83m x 2.73m\ncompact double with wooden laminate flooring, fitted units & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.30m x 1.82m\nwith Triton T90 Sr and bath with handheld shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window, fitted unit for storage.\n\nOutbuildings - 10m x 8m\nwith electricity connected\n\n"
      },
      {
