        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>6 bedroom detached residence extending to 2,500 sq. ft., approx. </li><li>Reconfigured in recent years to incorporate a self-contained two-bedroom apartment</li><li>Within walking distance to Duagh Village and all amenities </li><li>10 minute drive to the heritage town of Listowel </li><li>Substantial residence - the adjoining self-contained apartment provides for variety of uses - it is ideal for extended family living, guest accommodation or potential rental income.</li><li>Mature lawns, trees and hedging to the front and rear</li><li>80sqm detached garage approx. - ideal for storage / DIY purposes </li><li>Spacious paved patio area located off the kitchen/dining room</li><li>Mains connections to all essential services</li><li>Solid & oil-fired central heating</li><li>Double glazed upvc windows fitted throughout</li><li>Fibre broadband available </li><li></li><li>Distances: </li><li>Listowel 10 mins </li><li>Tralee 30 mins</li><li>Killarney 50 mins</ul>"
